# For the sanitizer build's tests that load SDL and the GL driver. LeakSanitizer
# (Linux only) reports allocations they keep until exit: SDL's per-thread error
# string on a thread it did not start, and the driver's context state.
leak:libSDL2
# The GL driver (Mesa's software rasteriser on the CI runner, frames with no module name)
# keeps two 56-byte objects from its draw path until exit; the stack ends in Renderer::draw.
leak:nativetv::Renderer::draw
